  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Revelators are warriors of radiance and justice. These oathsworn knights hold an honorable vow that becomes its own power.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Revelators</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Luke Skywalker, Star Wars</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Michael Carpenter, The Dresden Files</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• She-Ra, She-Ra: Princess of Power</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Wonder Woman, DC Comics</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Revelator</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Revelators are high defense frontline strikers. Stay in the frontline for melee attacks, and smite the transgressors.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Attack/Cast</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Frontline</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Starting Pack:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Knight or Warrior</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Melee, Leadership</span></p>",
